00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:05.338 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Avec son nouveau plan,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:06.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la Ville de Montréal a

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:07.774 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'intention de mieux desservir

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:09.008 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les quartiers laissés-pour-

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:10.243 size:53% position:73% line:53%
compte, comme Montréal-Nord.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:11.444 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On n'en a pas depuis

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.679 size:53% position:73% line:53%
42 ans à Montréal-Nord!

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:13.880 size:53% position:73% line:53%
