00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est 200 km de voies cyclables

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui s'ajouteront aux 800 km

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:31.364 size:53% position:73% line:53%
