00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:33.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par an. Avec sa Vision Vélo,

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:37.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal veut offrir plus

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:38.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de prévisibilité aux usagers

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:40.140 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la route.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:41.374 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On le voit, en ce moment,

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:42.575 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le stress que la fermeture

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.810 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la moitié du tunnel

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.044 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a occasionné.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:46.279 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et la Ville s'engage à bien

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.514 size:53% position:73% line:53%
consulter la population et ce,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.715 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avant chaque première pelletée

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:49.949 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de terre.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:51.184 size:53% position:73% line:53%
SOPHIE MAUZEROLLE, et

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:52.385 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la mobilité Ville de Montréal

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.586 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'idée, c'est vraiment

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:54.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de travailler avec la société

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:56.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
civile, donc faire preuve de

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
flexibilité pour sue,

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.491 size:53% position:73% line:53%
