00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:02.128 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vélo Québec salue

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.363 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'initia

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:04.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JEAN-FRANÇOIS RHEAULT,

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:05.832 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pdg Vélo Québec

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:07.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce qui est très important,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:08.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
