00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:13.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Nord...

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:14.440 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et certains de ces liens

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:15.675 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cyclablecyclablecyclablecyclable

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.910 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de commerces, ce qui peut amener

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:19.345 size:53% position:73% line:53%
