00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:29.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ou plus de clients,

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:30.356 size:53% position:73% line:53%
selon certains.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.524 size:53% position:73% line:53%
NATHALIE LEBOEUF, propriétaire,

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:32.659 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Toilettage Calimousse

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.760 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça va faire plus de gens,

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.861 size:53% position:73% line:53%
