00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.504 size:53% position:73% line:53%
FATIMA GABRIELA SALAZAR GOME

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.538 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Assoc. mobilité sécuritaire

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.573 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vous avez des besoins,

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:47.574 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les automobilistes; nous avons

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.608 size:53% position:73% line:53%
